cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "jevengineeringgate: a calibrated decision layer and risk gate for AI coding agents"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "RavenRepo"
    website: "https://github.com/RavenRepo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RavenRepo/jevengineeringgate"
url: "https://github.com/RavenRepo/jevengineeringgate"
abstract: >-
  An open-source decision layer for AI coding agents, built on the Jev System One
  model from TypeSafe AI. Routes yes/no, pick-one and score-this judgments away
  from expensive generative models to a model built to decide, and enforces the
  result deterministically through Claude Code PreToolUse and UserPromptSubmit
  hooks. Includes a fitted threshold calibration harness, a deterministic deny
  floor, output verification, model routing, and context compaction as a
  relevance filter rather than a summarization prompt.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - llm-guardrails
  - agent-safety
  - claude-code
  - decision-model
  - jev
  - typesafe-ai
  - calibration
  - context-compaction
  - tool-gating
